hadiths[33]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1714","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah ke ninyanwe naam hain, sau mein se ek kam. Jo unhe ginega wo Jannat mein dakhil hoga. Aur doosri riwayat mein izafa hai: Aur Wo taaq hai, taaq ko pasand farmata hai."
"1715","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi dua kare to sawal mein pakka irada kare. Aur hargiz na kahe: Ae Allah! Agar Tu chahe to mujhe de. Kyunke Usے majboor karne wala koi nahi."
"1716","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi hargiz na kahe: Ae Allah! Mujhe bakhsh de. Ae Allah! Mujh par rehem farma, agar Tu chahe. Sawal mein pakka irada kare. Kyunke Usے majboor karne wala koi nahi."
"1717","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi maut ki tamanna na kare us takleef ki wajah se jo use pahunchi ho. Phir agar wo maut ki tamanna karne wala hi ho to use chahiye ke kahe: Ae Allah! Mujhe zinda rakh jab tak zindagi mere liye behtar ho. Aur mujhe wafat de jab wafat mere liye behtar ho."
"1718","[AI-translation] Hazrat Khabbab se Qais ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Khabbab ke paas aaya jabke unhon ne apne pet mein saat dagh lagwaye they. Phir main ne unhe kehte suna: Agar Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne hamein maut ki dua se mana na farmaya hota to main us ki dua karta."
"1719","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ubada bin al-Samit (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jo Allah se mulaqat ko pasand kare, Allah us se mulaqat ko pasand farmata hai. Aur jo Allah se mulaqat ko na-pasand kare, Allah us se mulaqat ko na-pasand farmata hai."
"1720","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jo Allah se mulaqat ko pasand kare, Allah us se mulaqat ko pasand farmata hai. Aur jo Allah se mulaqat ko na-pasand kare, Allah us se mulaqat ko na-pasand farmata hai."
"1721","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Allah Ta'ala farmata hai: Main apne bande ke gumaan ke paas hun jo wo mujh se rakhe. Aur main us ke sath hun jab wo mujhe yaad kare. Phir agar wo mujhe apne dil mein yaad kare to main use apne dil mein yaad karta hun. Aur agar wo mujhe majlis mein yaad kare to main use us se behtar majlis mein yaad karta hun. Aur agar wo mujh se balisht bhar qareeb ho to main us se hath bhar qareeb hota hun. Aur agar wo mujh se hath bhar qareeb ho to main us se phelay hath qareeb hota hun. Aur agar wo mere paas chal kar aaye to main us ke paas daud kar aata hun."
"1722","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah ke farishte hain jo raston mein ghoomte hain, zikr walon ko talash karte hain. Phir agar wo aisi qaum payein jo Allah ko yaad karti ho to pukarte hain: Apni hajat ki taraf aao. Unhon ne kaha: Phir wo unhe apne paron se pehle aasman tak gher lete hain. Unhon ne kaha: Phir un ka Rab un se poochhta hai, jabke Wo un se zyada janta hai: Mere bande kya kehte hain? Unhon ne kaha: Wo kehte hain: Wo Teri tasbeeh karte hain, Teri takbeer kehte hain, Teri hamd karte hain, Teri badayi bayan karte hain. Unhon ne kaha: Phir Wo farmata hai: Kya unhon ne Mujhe dekha hai? Unhon ne kaha: Phir wo kehte hain: Nahi, Allah ki qasam! Unhon ne Tumhe nahi dekha. Unhon ne kaha: Phir Wo farmata hai: Aur kaise agar wo Mujhe dekhte? Unhon ne kaha: Wo kehte hain: Agar wo Tumhe dekhte to Teri ibadat mein zyada sakht hote, Tere liye tamjeed mein zyada sakht, Tere liye tasbeeh mein zyada. Unhon ne kaha: Wo farmata hai: Phir wo Mujh se kya mangte hain? Unhon ne kaha: Wo Tum se Jannat mangte hain. Unhon ne kaha: Wo farmata hai: Aur kya unhon ne use dekha hai? Unhon ne kaha: Wo kehte hain: Nahi, Allah ki qasam, ae mere Rab! Unhon ne use nahi dekha. Unhon ne kaha: Wo farmata hai: Phir kaise agar wo use dekhte? Unhon ne kaha: Wo kehte hain: Agar wo use dekhte to us par zyada harees hote, us ke talab mein zyada sakht, us mein raghbat mein bade. Unhon ne kaha: Phir wo kis se panah mangte hain? Unhon ne kaha: Wo kehte hain: Aag se. Unhon ne kaha: Wo farmata hai: Aur kya unhon ne use dekha hai? Unhon ne kaha: Wo kehte hain: Nahi, Allah ki qasam! Unhon ne use nahi dekha. Unhon ne kaha: Wo farmata hai: Phir kaise agar wo use dekhte? Unhon ne kaha: Wo kehte hain: Agar wo use dekhte to us se bhagne mein zyada sakht hote, us se darne mein zyada sakht. Unhon ne kaha: Phir Wo farmata hai: Phir main tumhe gawah banata hun ke main ne unhe bakhsh diya hai. Unhon ne kaha: Farishton mein se ek farishta kehta hai: Un mein falan hai jo un mein se nahi hai. Wo to hajat ke liye aaya tha. Unhon ne kaha: Wo hum-nasheen hain. Un ka hum-nasheen bad-bakht nahi hota."
"1723","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki aksar dua thi: Ae Allah! Ae hamare Rab! Hamein duniya mein bhalayi de, Aakhirat mein bhalayi de. Aur hamein Aag ke azab se bacha."
"1724","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo kahe: Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi, Wo akela hai, Us ka koi shareek nahi. Us ke liye badshahi hai aur Us ke liye hamd hai. Aur Wo har cheez par qadir hai, har din sau martaba, us ke liye dus gardanon ke barabar tha. Aur us ke liye sau nekiyan likhi gayein. Aur us se sau buraiyan mitayi gayein. Aur wo us ke liye us din shaitan se hifazat thi, yahan tak ke shaam kare. Aur koi us se afzal lekar nahi aaya jo wo lekar aaya, siwaye jis ne us se zyada amal kiya."
"1725","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo din mein sau martaba SubhanAllah wa bihamdihi kahe, us ki khatayein mitayi jayengi, agarche samandar ke jhag jaisi hon."
"1726","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Ayyub al-Ansari (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai: Jo dus martaba kahe: Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi, Wo akela hai, Us ka koi shareek nahi. Us ke liye badshahi hai, Us ke liye hamd hai. Aur Wo har cheez par qadir hai, wo us jaisa tha jo Aulad Ismail mein se gardan aazad kare."
"1727","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Do kalime zaban par halke hain, tarazu mein bhari hain, Rahman ko mehboob hain: SubhanAllah al-Azim, SubhanAllah wa bihamdihi."
"1728","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa al-Ash'ari (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Khaibar par hamla kiya, ya kaha: Jab Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) mutawajjah hue, to log wadi par chadhe. Phir unhon ne takbeer se apni awazein buland keen: Allahu Akbar, Allahu Akbar. Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi. To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Apne aap par narmi karo. Beshak tum behre aur ghayab ko nahi pukarte. Beshak tum sunne wale qareeb ko pukarte ho. Aur Wo tumhare sath hai. Aur main Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki sawari ke peechhe tha. Phir Aap ne mujhe suna jabke main kehta tha: Allah ke siwa na taqat na quwwat. To Aap ne mujh se farmaya: Ae Abdullah bin Qais! Main ne kaha: Labbaik Ya Rasulullah! Aap ne farmaya: Kya main tumhe Jannat ke khazanon mein se khazane ke kalime ki rahnumayi na karun? Main ne kaha: Kyun nahi Ya Rasulullah! Mere maan-baap Aap par fida hon. Aap ne farmaya: Allah ke siwa na taqat na quwwat."
"1729","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Bakr Siddiq (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se kaha: Mujhe dua sikhayiye jo main apni namaz mein mangun. Aap ne farmaya: Kaho: Ae Allah! Beshak main ne apni jaan par bahut zulm kiya. Aur gunahon ko Tere siwa koi nahi bakhshta. Phir mujhe apne paas se maghfirat se bakhsh de. Aur mujh par rehem farma. Beshak Tu bakhshne wala rehem wala hai."
"1730","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Abu Bakr Siddiq (raziyallahu anhu) ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Mujhe dua sikhayiye jo main apni namaz mein mangun. Aap ne farmaya: Kaho: Ae Allah! Beshak main ne apni jaan par bahut zulm kiya. Aur gunahon ko Tere siwa koi nahi bakhshta. Phir mujh par apne paas se maghfirat se bakhsh de. Beshak Tu bakhshne wala rehem wala hai."
"1731","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) farmate: Ae Allah! Beshak main Teri panah mangta hun Aag ke fitne se, Aag ke azab se, qabr ke fitne se, qabr ke azab se, ghina ke fitne ke shar se, faqr ke fitne ke shar se. Ae Allah! Beshak main Teri panah mangta hun Masih Dajjal ke fitne ke shar se. Ae Allah! Mere dil ko barf aur oolon ke pani se dho de. Aur mere dil ko khatayon se paak farma jaise Tune safed kapda mail se paak kiya. Aur mere aur meri khatayon ke darmiyan doori farma jaise Tune mashriq aur maghrib ke darmiyan doori farmayi. Ae Allah! Beshak main Teri panah mangta hun susti, gunah aur qarz se."
"1732","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabiullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) farmate: Ae Allah! Beshak main Teri panah mangta hun aajizi aur susti se, buzdili aur budhape se. Aur Teri panah mangta hun qabr ke azab se. Aur Teri panah mangta hun zindagi aur maut ke fitne se."
"1733","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) museebat ki sakhti, bad-bakhti ke pakde, buri taqdeer aur dushmanon ke khush hone se panah mangte."
"1734","[AI-translation] Hazrat Bara bin Azib (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum apne bistar par aao to namaz ke wuzu jaisa wuzu karo. Phir apne dayan pehlu par leto. Phir kaho: Ae Allah! Beshak main ne apna chehra Tere hawale kiya. Aur apna mamla Tere hawale kiya. Aur apni peeth Teri taraf lagayi, raghbat aur dar se Teri taraf. Tujh se Tere siwa koi panah aur najaat nahi. Ae Allah! Main Teri kitab par iman laya jo Tune nazil farmayi, Tere Nabi par jo Tune bheja. Phir agar tum apni raat mein maro to fitrat par ho. Aur unhe aakhri banao jo tum baat karte ho. Unhon ne kaha: Phir main ne use Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko doharaya. Phir jab main pahuncha: Ae Allah! Main Teri kitab par iman laya jo Tune nazil farmayi, to main ne kaha: Aur Tere Rasool par. Aap ne farmaya: Nahi. Aur Tere Nabi par jo Tune bheja."
"1735","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se ek apne bistar par aaye to use chahiye ke apne tehband ke andar se apna bistar jhaade. Kyunke wo nahi janta ke us ke peechhe us par kya hai. Phir kahe: Tere naam se, ae mere Rab! Main ne apna pehlu rakha. Aur Tujh se uthata hun. Agar Tune meri jaan rok li to us par rehem farma. Aur agar use bheja to us ki hifazat farma jis se Tu nek logon ki hifazat farmata hai."
"1736","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) farmate: Main Teri izzat ki panah mangta hun jis ke siwa koi mabood nahi, jo nahi marta. Jabke jinn aur insan marte hain."
"1737","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai ke Wo is dua se dua farmate: Ae mere Rab! Meri khata, jahalat aur mere tamam mamle mein zyadati bakhsh de. Aur jo Tu mujh se zyada janta hai. Ae Allah! Meri khatayein, jaan-boojh, jahalat aur hansi bakhsh de. Aur ye sab mere paas hai. Ae Allah! Jo main ne aage bheja, peechhe kiya, chhupaya, zahir kiya bakhsh de. Tu aage karne wala hai, Tu peechhe karne wala hai. Aur Tu har cheez par qadir hai."
"1738","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) farmate: Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi, Wo akela hai. Us ne apne lashkar ko izzat di. Apne bande ki madad ki. Girohon par akele ghalba paya. Phir Us ke baad kuchh nahi."
"1739","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Fatima (alaihassalam) ne chakki ke nishan ki shikayat ki jo wo patin. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas qaidi aaye. Phir wo chalein aur Aap ko na paya. Phir Aisha ko paya. Phir unhe khabar di. Phir jab Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) tashreef laye to Aap ko Aisha ne Fatima ke aane ki khabar di. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) hamare paas tashreef laye, jabke hum ne apne bistar pakde they. Phir main uthne laga. To Aap ne farmaya: Apni jagah raho. Phir Aap hamare darmiyan baithe yahan tak ke main ne Aap ke qadmon ki thandak apne seene par payi. Aur farmaya: Kya main tumhe us se behtar na sikhayun jo tum ne manga? Jab tum apne bistar pakdo to chauntees martaba takbeer kaho, taintees martaba tasbeeh kaho, taintees martaba hamd kaho. Phir wo tumhare liye khadim se behtar hai."
"1740","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum murghon ki awazein suno to Allah se Us ke fazl ka sawal karo. Kyunke us ne farishta dekha hai. Aur jab tum gadhon ki awazein suno to Allah se shaitan se panah mango. Kyunke us ne shaitan dekha hai."
"1741","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) museebat ke waqt farmate: Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi, jo bada burdbar hai. Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi, jo azeem Arsh ka Rab hai. Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi, jo aasmanon ka Rab hai, zameen ka Rab hai, izzat wale Arsh ka Rab hai."
"1742","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se ek ki dua qubool hoti hai jab tak jaldi na kare. Wo kehta hai: Main ne dua ki aur meri dua qubool nahi hui."
"1743","[AI-translation] Hazrat Usama (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Main Jannat ke darwaze par khada hua. Phir us mein dakhil hone walon mein aksar miskeen they. Aur maal wale roke hue hain, magar Dozakh walon ko Aag ki taraf hukm diya gaya hai. Aur main Aag ke darwaze par khada hua. Phir us mein dakhil hone walon mein aksar aurtein thein."
"1744","[AI-translation] Hazrat Usama bin Zaid (raziyallahu anhuma) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Main ne apne baad mardon par aurton se zyada nuqsan-deh fitna nahi chhora."
"1745","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Teen nikle jo chal rahe they. Phir unhe barish lagi. Phir wo pahad mein ghaar mein dakhil hue. Phir un par chattaan giri. Unhon ne kaha: Phir un mein se ek ne doosre se kaha: Allah se apne sab se afzal amal se dua karo jo tum ne kiya ho. Phir un mein se ek ne kaha: Ae Allah! Beshak mere budhe bade walidain they. Phir main nikalta aur charata. Phir aata aur duhta. Phir doodh lekar aata. Phir use apne walidain ke paas lata. Phir wo dono peete. Phir bachchon, ghar walon aur biwi ko pilata. Phir ek raat ruka. Phir aaya. Phir wo dono soye they. Unhon ne kaha: Phir main ne na-pasand kiya ke unhe jagayun. Jabke bachche mere qadmon ke paas ro rahe they. Phir ye mera aur un ka mamul raha yahan tak ke Fajr tulu hui. Ae Allah! Agar Tu janta hai ke main ne ye Tera chehra chahte hue kiya to hum se kushadgi khol jis se hum aasman dekhein. Unhon ne kaha: Phir un se khol di gayi. Aur doosre ne kaha: Ae Allah! Agar Tu janta hai ke main apne chacha ki beti se mohabbat karta tha, jaise mard aurton se sakht mohabbat karta hai. Phir us ne kaha: Tum us mein se nahi paoge yahan tak ke use sau deenar do. Phir main us mein koshish karta raha yahan tak ke unhe jama kiya. Phir jab main us ke dono paon ke darmiyan baitha to us ne kaha: Allah se daro. Aur angoothi ko us ke haq ke siwa na todo. Phir main utha aur use chhora. Phir agar Tu janta hai ke main ne ye Tera chehra chahte hue kiya to hum se kushadgi khol. Unhon ne kaha: Phir un se do tihayi khol di gayi. Aur doosre ne kaha: Ae Allah! Agar Tu janta hai ke main ne mazdoor ko faraq bhar jau par mazdoori par rakha. Phir use diya. Aur us ne lene se inkar kiya ke wo le. Phir main us faraq ki taraf gaya. Phir use boya yahan tak ke us se gaayen aur us ka charwaha khareeda. Phir wo aaya. Phir us ne kaha: Ae Allah ke bande! Mujhe mera haq de. Phir main ne kaha: Un gaayon aur us ke charwahe ki taraf jao. Kyunke wo tumhare liye hain. To us ne kaha: Kya tum mujh se mazaq karte ho? Unhon ne kaha: Phir main ne kaha: Main tum se mazaq nahi karta. Lekin wo tumhare liye hain. Ae Allah! Agar Tu janta hai ke main ne ye Tera chehra chahte hue kiya to hum se khol. Phir un se khol di gayi."
"1746","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Allah Ta'ala farmata hai: Main apne bande ke gumaan ke paas hun jo wo mujh se rakhe. Aur main us ke sath hun jab wo mujhe yaad kare. Phir agar wo mujhe apne dil mein yaad kare to main use apne dil mein yaad karta hun. Aur agar wo mujhe majlis mein yaad kare to main use us se behtar majlis mein yaad karta hun. Aur agar wo mujh se balisht bhar qareeb ho to main us se hath bhar qareeb hota hun. Aur agar wo mujh se hath bhar qareeb ho to main us se phelay hath qareeb hota hun. Aur agar wo mere paas chal kar aaye to main us ke paas daud kar aata hun."
